\[
y_6 \leq y_1
\]

**4. Contingent Constraint (Project 10 requires 5):**
\[
y_{10} \leq y_5
\]

**5. Binary Variables:**
\[
y_i \in \{0,1\} \quad \forall i = 1, \ldots, 110
\]

